### 1. 新增一个会员（剩余 3 课时）
POST http://localhost:8081/api/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "张三",
  "phone": "13800000001",
  "remainingSessions": 3
}

### 2. 新增一节容量为 2 的课
POST http://localhost:8082/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "瑜伽入门",
  "coach": "李教练",
  "capacity": 2,
  "bookedCount": 0
}

### 3. 检查会员（应返回 OK）
GET http://localhost:8081/api/members/1/check

### 4. 检查课程（应返回 OK）
GET http://localhost:8082/api/courses/1/check

### 5. 预约课程（核心，参数写在 URL 上）
POST http://localhost:8083/api/book?memberId=1&courseId=1

### 6. 再约一次（观察课时和名额继续减少）
POST http://localhost:8083/api/book?memberId=1&courseId=1

### 7. 新增一个没有课时的会员
POST http://localhost:8081/api/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "王五",
  "phone": "13800000002",
  "remainingSessions": 0
}

### 8. 用没课时的会员预约（应失败）
POST http://localhost:8083/api/book?memberId=2&courseId=1
